      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Glen Spey’s landscape includes Mohican Lake, a 180‑acre reservoir with 8 miles of shoreline popular for fishing and hiking.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
